BT
/F1 10 Tf
50 780 Td
13 TL
(NLP-Based Intelligent Web Application Development) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Project Title: NoteAI Lessons - Speech-to-Text Notes and AI Lesson Assistant) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Selected Stack:) Tj
T*
(- Frontend: HTML) Tj
T*
(- Backend: PHP) Tj
T*
(- Database: Supabase) Tj
T*
(- NLP Tools: NLTK and spaCy) Tj
T*
(- Supporting Assets: CSS, Bootstrap, JavaScript) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Project Idea:) Tj
T*
(The app works like cellphone notes. Students type or dictate lesson notes.) Tj
T*
(Every saved note is analyzed with NLP and stored in Supabase. The AI assistant) Tj
T*
(then scans saved notes to answer direct lesson questions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Implemented NLP Concepts:) Tj
T*
(1. Tokenization - NLTK displays tokenized note text.) Tj
T*
(2. Lemmatization - spaCy provides base forms for better search.) Tj
T*
(3. Sentiment Analysis - NLTK VADER classifies Positive, Negative, or Neutral.) Tj
T*
(4. Voice-to-Text - Dictate Note writes speech into the note editor.) Tj
T*
(5. Text-to-Speech - Speak Answer reads assistant output aloud.) Tj
T*
(6. Chatbot Assistant - scans saved notes and returns matching lessons.) Tj
T*
(7. Keyword Extraction - spaCy-assisted important term extraction.) Tj
T*
(8. Text Classification - Complaint, Inquiry, Feedback, Command, or General.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(System Workflow:) Tj
T*
(Create note -> speech/text input -> PHP notes API -> Python NLTK/spaCy NLP -> Supabase notes table.) Tj
T*
(Ask question -> PHP chat API -> analyze query -> scan note keywords/lemmas/content -> return lesson answer.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Supabase Tables:) Tj
T*
(notes: id, title, content, tokens, lemmas, keywords, sentiment, sentiment_score, classification, entities, created_at, updated_at.) Tj
T*
(assistant_chats: id, question, answer, query_tokens, query_keywords, matched_note_ids, created_at.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(How to Run:) Tj
T*
(1. Run database/nlp_assistant.sql in the Supabase SQL Editor.) Tj
T*
(2. Copy .env.example to .env and set SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_KEY.) Tj
T*
(3. python3 -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate) Tj
T*
(4. pip install -r requirements.txt) Tj
T*
(5. python3 -m spacy download en_core_web_sm) Tj
T*
(6. php -S 127.0.0.1:8000) Tj
T*
(7. Open http://127.0.0.1:8000) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Defense Demo Checklist:) Tj
T*
(Create a note by voice, show tokens/lemmas/sentiment/keywords, ask the assistant about the lesson, show matched notes, and use Speak Answer.) Tj
T*
ET
